}

docs {
  # Ask Article Question
  
  Asks an AI-powered question about a specific article. The system retrieves relevant content chunks from the article's translation and generates a RAG-based answer.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description              |
  |-----------|------|----------|--------------------------|
  | id        | uuid | Yes      | The article's UUID       |
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Default | Description                        |
  |-----------|--------|----------|---------|------------------------------------|
  | language  | string | No       | `en`    | Language code (e.g. `en`, `pcm`)   |
  
  ## Request Body
  
  | Field    | Type   | Required | Description                         |
  |----------|--------|----------|-------------------------------------|
  | question | string | Yes      | The question to ask (1–1000 chars)  |
  
  ## Success Response (200)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Question answered successfully",
    "data": {
      "answer": "The symptoms of malaria include fever, chills, headache...",
      "sources": [
        {
          "chunkId": "uuid",
          "translationId": "uuid",
          "content": "The source chunk text used for context...",
          "chunkIndex": 0,
          "similarityScore": 0.85
        }
      ],
      "tokensUsed": {
        "prompt": 350,
        "completion": 120,
        "total": 470
      },
      "model": "gpt-4o"
    },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Not Found Error (404)
  
  Returned when the article ID does not exist or is not published.
  
  ```json
  {
    "status": false,
    "error": {
      "code": "NOT_FOUND",
      "message": "Article not found"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Validation Error (400)
  
  ```json
  {
    "status": false,
    "error": {
      "code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
      "message": "Request validation failed",
      "details": [
        { "field": "question", "message": "Question is required" }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```
}
